WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.058
The method is evaluated in two settings.

00:00:04.138 --> 00:00:08.196
For standard in-domain language modeling the
authors use WikiText-103,

00:00:08.276 --> 00:00:12.334
a Wikipedia benchmark with one hundred and three
million training tokens,

00:00:12.414 --> 00:00:16.472
and a two hundred forty seven million parameter
Transformer as the base model,

00:00:16.552 --> 00:00:20.610
producing a datastore of one hundred and three
million entries clustered into one million states.

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:24.748
For domain adaptation they use the law-domain
corpus Law-MT with nineteen million tokens

00:00:24.828 --> 00:00:28.886
and a larger six hundred fifty six million
parameter base model,

00:00:28.966 --> 00:00:33.024
clustered into two hundred thousand states.

00:00:33.104 --> 00:00:37.162
Throughout,

00:00:37.242 --> 00:00:41.300
RetoMaton is compared against the original kNN-LM
and against Adaptive Retrieval.
